    {
      "text": "Figure 3: Impact of Chain Depth on file-level localization accuracy Acc@1(File) evaluated on SWE-Bench-Verified-S (75 instances). Acc@1(File) increases from 70.7% at depth 1, to 72.0% at depth 3, peaking at 86.7% at depth 5, before declining to 82.7% at depth 7 due to extraneous noise in excessively long dependency chains.",
